    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "One and a half",
     "texto": [
      "**Полтора** (masculine and neuter) and **полторы** (feminine) take the singular genitive: **полтора часа** («one and a half hours»), **полторы недели** («one and a half weeks»).",
      "For two and a half, three and a half... **с половиной** is used: **два с половиной часа** («two and a half hours»)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Half, a third, a quarter",
     "texto": [
      "**Половина** («half»), **треть** («a third») and **четверть** («a quarter») take the genitive: **половина города** («half of the city»), **треть времени** («a third of the time»), **четверть часа** («a quarter of an hour»)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
